    "name": "Trash Horror Collection 5",
    "steam_appid": 3569980,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/07c1cf08a6133ff1c9d2982156b44b19.avif?t=1742368684\" data-has-big width=800 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>7 different games</strong> inspired by cult horror movies from the 80's and 90's. That exaggerated horror in some cases even comical and disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some games are more horror and tension oriented, others are based on bullshit movies like (Scary Movie).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each game has its own particularity, making them unique! Embark on various adventures and take a dive back to the 80s.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What games come in this collection?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1873</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/85b38f134e82ab75c14131f409d1dcd2.poster.avif?t=1742368684\" width=590 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/85b38f134e82ab75c14131f409d1dcd2.webm?t=1742368684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;1873&quot;</strong> is a horror and investigation game, with elements of armed combat. Using the vibe of the 1800s.\u00a0For those who are used to my games, this one has a very different style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DAD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/be92e2f0c608c8b1ff0b51de855e53cb.avif?t=1742368684\" width=590 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;DAD&quot;</strong> is a horror game with a bizarre style and story. Inspired by horror and suspense films from the 80s and 90s. With PS1 style graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fart Killer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/040b00f94f4195ffcb0fbe6137e4222c.poster.avif?t=1742368684\" width=590 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/040b00f94f4195ffcb0fbe6137e4222c.webm?t=1742368684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/040b00f94f4195ffcb0fbe6137e4222c.mp4?t=1742368684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Fart Killer&quot;</strong> is a short trash comedy game mixed with cult horror from the 80s. With totally absurd and meaningless scenes. Don't expect a super Hollywood production...\u00a0It's much better than that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gears 2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/8c6a1a31b7dec07a7ba3e1c799fa4786.poster.avif?t=1742368684\" width=590 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/8c6a1a31b7dec07a7ba3e1c799fa4786.webm?t=1742368684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/8c6a1a31b7dec07a7ba3e1c799fa4786.mp4?t=1742368684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Gears 2&quot;</strong> is a psychological survival horror game. Inspired by the movies &quot;SAW&quot;. Bringing different mechanics from the first game.\u00a0Bringing tense moments with a lot of gore... forcing you to make decisions that will lead to life or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Halloween Revenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/66a64ba957e44e76d9aca0d28c218d69.poster.avif?t=1742368684\" width=590 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/66a64ba957e44e76d9aca0d28c218d69.webm?t=1742368684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/66a64ba957e44e76d9aca0d28c218d69.mp4?t=1742368684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Halloween Revenge&quot;</strong> is a short horror game inspired by trash horror movies from the 80s.\u00a0Mixing weird horror with comedy and weird characters. This mix results in a nostalgic game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trash Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/1851b5360adff0039a4d19b66e15d2db.poster.avif?t=1742368684\" width=590 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/1851b5360adff0039a4d19b66e15d2db.webm?t=1742368684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/1851b5360adff0039a4d19b66e15d2db.mp4?t=1742368684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Trash Night&quot;</strong> is a horror and drama game inspired by the cult horror films of the 80s and 90s... The golden age of VHS tapes.\u00a0With &quot;PS1&quot; style graphics and an environment reminiscent of low-budget films.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We Are not Alone - Contact</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/2cb72caed6bcda88804217500c3fd78f.poster.avif?t=1742368684\" width=590 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/2cb72caed6bcda88804217500c3fd78f.webm?t=1742368684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/2cb72caed6bcda88804217500c3fd78f.mp4?t=1742368684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;We Are Not Alone - Contact&quot;</strong> is a reimagining of the first game. Inspired by alien horror films from the 80s, bringing comical horror and at the same time scary and bloody.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/f97af891e00da7f7590fba0abe2e319f.avif?t=1742368684\" data-has-big width=800 height=145 /></span></p>",
